            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Bagel Meter 1.2

- Bagel Meter now updates itself. It checks once a day and asks before installing. You can also click **Check for updates** at the bottom.
- The Friends tab follows the **Compact** checkbox: one small table per friend, one row per account.
- Friends' accounts show their email and an icon you can pick.
]]></description>
